{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower Up \u2013 Build your way to the top!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tower Up</i> is a physics-based building game where your goal is simple: <strong>reach the top</strong>. Place blocks carefully, balance unstable shapes, and climb higher and higher without everything falling apart beneath you. The journey takes you up one massive vertical map\u2014<strong> with multiple stages of increasing difficulty</strong>. One wrong move, and it could all come crashing down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf1 How it works:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based block placement</strong> \u2013 No snapping, no grids. Just you, gravity, and your sense of balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic stacking</strong> \u2013 Different block shapes and sizes make every placement a puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One goal</strong> \u2013 Reach the top using only your skill and creativity.<br><br><strong>&quot;Man proposes...&quot;</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...God disposes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/Untitled_design__2_.gif?t=1749419815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Climb alone Or bring the whole crew along! <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/extras/HighresScreenshot00027.png?t=1749419815\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618840?t=1749419815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618840?t=1749419815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618840/a